[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5529939378","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123094#issuecomment-5529939378","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123094","id":5529939378,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSZwtsg","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T18:01:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T18:01:17Z","body":"The change itself is good, including the spacer workaround, but that is also need in other places in the editor. So instead of playing wack-a-mole, a better solution would be to make `FlowContainer` able place its children to the opposite side, so no workaround would be needed to begin with.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5529939378/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5533621190","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123094#issuecomment-5533621190","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123094","id":5533621190,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSdRbxg","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T23:49:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T00:23:23Z","body":"It isn't really a workaround, I consider it more ideal and clearly defined than [what I said in the other PR.](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119306#issuecomment-5383159394) For example, if `HFlowContainer` were to bleed into three lines, how would we even define what gets aligned where? Would we do left-center-right? Then, what about four? I couldn't really clearly lay out the rules for it, until I discovered this.\r\n\r\nIn the case of doing it the way this PR does,\r\n1. If one extra element from the leftside bleeds into the second line, the right align for the edit block is maintained.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aeb5de12-fbef-4a5e-b8e1-20b277b9b349\r\n\r\n2. In the case that the rightside block isn't visible, we probably prefer this, not a right align.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"593\" height=\"462\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/544d19d2-225f-4199-a8d8-db4aa1865602\" />\r\n\r\nIt seems a lot more straightforward.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5533621190/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5536501860","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123094#issuecomment-5536501860","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123094","id":5536501860,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSgBQZA","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T06:14:13Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T06:14:13Z","body":"Fair enough, but the fact that other parts of the editor need this too still stands, so we will need to address them sometime.","auth